<title>SINGAPORE: Amtek increases stake in Thai unit.</title>
<headline>Amtek increases stake in Thai unit.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amtek Engineering Ltd said on Wednesday it has agreed to buy an additional five percent of the shares in a Thai company, taking its stake to 50 percent.</p>
<p>Amtek said it would pay Singapore $193,050 for the additional stake in Cheval Electronic Enclosure Co Ltd, a standard switchboard enclosure and metal stamping company.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
